  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A charge +Q and a charge −2Q are a distance 3x apart. Point P is on the line joining the charges, at a distance x from +Q.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The magnitude of the electric field produced at P by the charge +Q alone is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the total electric field at P?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E}{2}\"></span> to the right</li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E}{2}\"></span> to the left</li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3E}{2}\"></span> to the right</li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3E}{2}\"></span> to the left</li></ol>"
  },
